---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const lastUpdated = "March 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Nunya Bunya" description="Privacy Policy for Nunya Bunya digital marketing services.">
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="font-body font-semibold text-magenta text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-[900] text-4xl md:text-6xl mb-4">PRIVACY POLICY</h1>
      <p class="text-white/40 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-white/70 leading-relaxed">

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
          <p>Nunya Bunya ("we", "us", "our") is a digital marketing agency based in Brisbane, Queensland, Australia. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect information you provide directly, including:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2 text-white/60">
            <li>Name and email address (via contact and signup forms)</li>
            <li>Business name and details</li>
            <li>Communications you send to us</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We also collect usage data automatically via Vercel Analytics, including pages visited, referral sources, and general location (country/city level). No cookies are used for tracking.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use your information to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2 text-white/60">
            <li>Respond to enquiries and provide services</li>
            <li>Send service-related communications</li>
            <li>Improve our website and services</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">4. Data Storage & Security</h2>
          <p>Your data is stored securely. We use Resend for email delivery and Vercel for website hosting — both are reputable services with strong security practices. We retain your data only as long as necessary to provide services or as required by law.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">5. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete personal information we hold about you. To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:ben@nunyabunya.com" class="text-teal hover:text-magenta transition-colors">ben@nunyabunya.com</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">6. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>Our website uses:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2 text-white/60">
            <li><strong class="text-white">Vercel Analytics</strong> — privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Resend</strong> — email delivery for form submissions</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Cal.com</strong> — booking calendar (subject to Cal.com's privacy policy)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top will reflect any changes. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading font-[900] text-xl text-white mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
          <p>Privacy questions or concerns? Email us at <a href="mailto:ben@nunyabunya.com" class="text-teal hover:text-magenta transition-colors">ben@nunyabunya.com</a>.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
